+<?php
+// WP-A items 1, 16, 17: first-contact bands + opening-stance rule, personality anchor (a profile refresh may not drop a core
+// trait, repeated phrases are detected), and claim checking against the native snapshot (fail-closed when unknown).
+// Pure-function test; must FAIL on the baseline (none of the lib/imm26_*.php files exist there).
